    <p>We'll give notice when it's practical and safe to do so.</p>

    <h2>Third-party services</h2>
    <p>Portico may depend on operating systems, app stores, certificate authorities, email delivery, networks and other third-party services. Their own terms and privacy practices apply to their services. Portico isn't responsible for independently operated servers, or for third-party products, content, availability or conduct.</p>

